    gestureTarget: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    expression: 0.34
    portuguese: "Santa Luz. Daqui, parece que o porto inteiro acabou de acordar."
    english: "Santa Luz. From here, it looks like the whole port just woke up."
  - start: 5.83
    seconds: 6.37
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ddcbf9f3c83937c9fb8abf9b21de35fe, type: 3}
    gestureTarget: {x: 1.35, y: 1.18, z: 1.9}
    expression: -0.65
    portuguese: "Quando a Lia falou das notas do cais, achei que era s\u00f3 um erro. Ela n\u00e3o teria me chamado por causa de um erro."
    english: "When Lia mentioned the dock invoices, I thought they were a mistake. She wouldn't have called me over a mistake."
